[[Batteries]] are pickups that add charges to Isaac's active item.

'''Battery''' may also refer to:

== Items ==
* {{i|9 Volt}}, recharges one bar of an active item after each use.
* {{i|The Battery}}, allows activated items to store an additional full charge.
* {{i|Car Battery}}, doubles the effect of Isaac's active items.
* {{i|4.5 Volt}}, gain charges from dealing damage instead of clearing rooms.
* {{i|Battery Pack}}, spawns 2-4 battery pickups.
* {{i|Jumper Cables}}, recharges Isaac's active item by 1 bar for every 15 enemies killed.

== Trinkets ==
* {{t|AAA Battery}}, recharges the last bar of an active item.
* {{t|Charged Penny}}, grants a small chance to gain 1 bar of charge on Isaac's active item when picking up {{e|Penny|text=coins}}.
* {{t|Old Capacitor}}, Isaac's active item no longer gains charges, but greatly increases Battery drop rates.
* {{t|Watch Battery}}, increases chance of {{e|Lil' Battery}} pickups, grants chance to add an extra charge upon room completion.

== Familiars ==
* {{i|Charged Baby}}, occasionally spawns batteries and adds charges to Isaac's active item.

== Pickups ==
* [[48 Hour Energy]], a pill that fully charges Isaac's active item and drops one or two {{e|Lil' Battery}} pickups.

